<p>The museum is open and staffed each Saturday and Sunday June through August from 1:00 PM to 4:00 PM which corresponds to those of the Railroad Museum. We can also be open by upon request for special events. Among the displays is a signed letter from Theodore Roosevelt to past Mandan city mayor Dr. Henry Coe; and the original hotel registery from the Merchant Hotel in the 1880s including Grover Cleveland's signature.</p>

